<title>USA: ATHLETICS-U.S. CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-U.S. CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of finals on the</p>
<p>third day of the five-day U.S. athletics championships on</p>
<p>Friday at Indiana Track Stadium. Top three qualify for world</p>
<p>championships except in the women's pole vault, which is not</p>
<p>contested there.</p>
<p>Women's pole vault</p>
<p> 1. Stacy Dragila		 4.30 metres</p>
<p> 2. Melissa Price		 4.00</p>
<p> 3. Melissa Mueller	     3.95</p>
